WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER: WE DO NOT OWN THE CHARACTERS
===============================================================================

None of the following is ours, and none of it is licensed under MIT:

- THE CHARACTERS. Every character the costumes and stickers show, and their
  names, belong to their respective owners. This includes characters from
  Spider-Man, Sonic the Hedgehog, SpongeBob SquarePants, Minecraft, Five Nights
  at Freddy's, Jujutsu Kaisen, One Piece, Adventure Time and The Amazing World
  of Gumball. They are trademarks and copyrighted works of those owners. We do
  not own them and claim no rights to them.

- THE COSTUME MODELS (public/assets/costumes/). These are fan-made 3D models
  by their Sketchfab authors, used under the licenses listed for each one in
  CREDITS.md (CC BY 4.0, and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for Patrick Star). We only
  converted them to VRM and rigged them.

- THE STICKER SHEETS (public/assets/stickers/). These are collages of
  character art owned by the characters' rights holders.

- THE PHOTOS AND SCREENSHOTS (docs/). These are included only to show the
  project and are not licensed for reuse.

- THIRD-PARTY FILES bundled so the app works offline: the MediaPipe models and
  engine (public/mediapipe/, Apache License 2.0), the fonts (public/fonts/,
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, see public/fonts/OFL.txt) and the Lucide icons
  (ISC and MIT, see CREDITS.md).

This is a non-commercial fan project made for school events. It is not
affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by any of the rights holders or
model authors. Do not use the costumes or stickers for commercial purposes. If
you reuse this project with these or other characters, getting the rights to
them is your responsibility.

If you own any of this material and want it removed, open an issue on the
repository and we will remove it.

